OL,3,AJet may have broken apart before
OL,4,AFlorida crash, officials say, as family
OL,5,Anamed among victims
OL,6,
OL,7,FInvestigators believe parts of a
OL,8,Fprivate jet that crashed in Florida and
OL,9,Fkilled all nine onboard may have broken
OL,10,Foff while it was in the air.
OL,12,FThe Learjet 60 had been bound for the
OL,13,FBahamas from Austin, Texas when it
OL,14,Fnosedived into a multi-lane highway and
OL,15,Fexploded on impact.
OL,17,FA tech entrepreneur and his young
OL,18,Ffamily, as well as the 20-year-old
OL,19,Fco-pilot, were among those who died on
OL,20,FSunday.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
