OL,3,AJet may have broken apart before
OL,4,AFlorida crash, officials say, as family
OL,5,Anamed among victims
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US National Transportation Safety
OL,8,FBoard (NTSB) said weather conditions
OL,9,Fwould be a major focus of the
OL,10,Finvestigation but that it was
OL,11,Fstruggling to access the wreckage due
OL,12,Fto the huge crater created by the jet
OL,13,Fon the road in Palm Beach.
